  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "生命周期绑定",
      "items": [
        "Glide.with(activity) 由 RequestManagerRetriever 取 fragmentGet 创建的 RequestManager，Activity 销毁时 onDestroy 自动 clearRequests",
        "onStop 默认 pauseRequests，恢复时 resumeRequests 把 pendingRequests 重新 begin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "四级复用",
      "items": [
        "Engine.load 依次查 ActiveResources、MemoryCache，再进入 EngineJob/DecodeJob；相同 EngineKey 的并发加载共享同一个 EngineJob",
        "DecodeJob 的 Stage 由 DiskCacheStrategy 决定：decodeCachedResource→RESOURCE_CACHE，decodeCachedData→DATA_CACHE，最后 SOURCE"
      ]
    }
  ]
